  "title_lines": [
   "\u0398-Categories and Tannakian duality"
  ],
  "abstract": "We introduce a notion of\u0398-categories, which is a refinement of the notion of symmetric monoidal\u221e-categories. We use this notion to prove a Tannakian duality statement, relating\u0398-categories with fpqc- stacks by means of a certain stack of fiber functors in the context of \u0398-categories. This provides, over a base ring of arbitrary characteris- tic, a strong link betweenTannakian \u0398-categories and the schematic homotopy types of [Toe06].",
